WEBVTT

00:05.207 --> 00:06.827
We just can't anymore.

00:10.667 --> 00:13.697
Well, good luck with your next party.

00:13.697 --> 00:17.067
Though I don't know who'd recruit a loser

00:17.067 --> 00:22.197
who can't level up anymore 
because of their bad build.

00:24.277 --> 00:27.957
<i>They say relationships only last 
as long as the money does.</i>

00:28.737 --> 00:31.947
<i>The skill point system is brutal.</i>

00:34.787 --> 00:37.357
I wasn't expecting 
a Blood-Soaked Sword to drop.

00:42.967 --> 00:47.067
It's because of my skills, you know.

00:49.017 --> 00:53.047
They worked, didn't they?

00:56.087 --> 00:58.987
Because of you, huh?

00:59.627 --> 01:04.387
We finally got this rare drop after 
visiting the Dungeon a bunch of times.

01:04.667 --> 01:09.067
I'm not sure that it really was 
because of your skills.

01:09.667 --> 01:10.707
<i>Could it be?</i>

01:11.227 --> 01:13.367
<i>Does she have that skill tree?</i>

01:14.147 --> 01:17.727
<i>Who'd kick someone with </i>that<i> skill tree?</i>

01:17.727 --> 01:20.737
<i>But based on that conversation, 
that must be it.</i>

01:20.737 --> 01:25.867
<i>If I'm right, she's got 
a broken skill tree.</i>

01:28.037 --> 01:30.697
I'm sorry for being selfish!

01:30.987 --> 01:33.017
You never have to pay me again!

01:33.017 --> 01:36.207
Please keep me in the party!

01:40.047 --> 01:42.197
Wh-Who are you?!

01:42.197 --> 01:43.287
Please!

01:48.067 --> 01:52.497
Please! Will you form a party with me?

01:53.237 --> 01:55.767
A p-p-party?!

02:42.397 --> 02:43.647
<b>Loading</b>

02:54.907 --> 02:56.207
<b>Loading</b>

03:07.547 --> 03:08.837
<b>Loading</b>

03:17.097 --> 03:17.847
<b>Loading</b>

03:19.347 --> 03:24.937
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

03:19.357 --> 03:24.937
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

03:36.077 --> 03:40.497
<b>Episode 6\h\h\hRuche the Pierrot</b>

03:58.407 --> 03:59.997
How did this happen?

03:59.997 --> 04:01.937
Some days are just like that.

04:06.527 --> 04:10.737
Please! You won't regret it! 
Let's form a party!

04:11.007 --> 04:13.367
How about an 80/20 split?

04:13.367 --> 04:16.037
I couldn't do 20% forever.

04:16.287 --> 04:19.537
I couldn't afford to support myself.

04:19.537 --> 04:22.537
You'd get 80%, of course. 
I'm fine with 20%.

04:22.857 --> 04:24.427
I-Is that okay?

04:24.427 --> 04:25.967
<i>That's</i> what you meant?!

04:25.967 --> 04:28.547
P-Please calm down.

04:28.877 --> 04:33.047
First, could you let go of my hand?

04:33.307 --> 04:34.717
Oh, sorry.

04:34.717 --> 04:36.847
Hey, what the hell is this?

04:36.847 --> 04:39.857
Who the hell do you think you are?

04:39.857 --> 04:41.297
I'm Elymas.

04:41.297 --> 04:44.227
I overheard that she's leaving your party.

04:44.527 --> 04:46.967
So I came to scout her.

04:46.967 --> 04:49.127
Are you out of your mind?

04:49.737 --> 04:54.757
She's so piss-poor in combat 
that she can't level properly.

04:55.707 --> 04:57.997
That's fine. It's not a problem.

05:09.327 --> 05:10.897
I hope you don't regret it.

05:10.897 --> 05:17.797
You'll be saving us some guilt
if you take in that useless girl.

05:18.917 --> 05:19.807
Go ahead.

05:20.207 --> 05:22.087
Take her.

05:22.807 --> 05:25.307
I'm not asking for your permission.

05:25.757 --> 05:26.717
What?

05:30.277 --> 05:32.277
<b>Panic</b>

05:30.277 --> 05:32.277
<b>Panic</b>

05:37.817 --> 05:39.567
<b>Panic</b>

05:40.947 --> 05:45.077
What level are you? 
Do you have other party members?

05:45.517 --> 05:49.187
I'm a level 23 solo Heavy Knight.

05:49.187 --> 05:51.587
I'm an E-rank adventurer.

05:51.587 --> 05:54.847
A level 23 solo Heavy Knight?

05:55.637 --> 06:00.887
Someone your level 
should know how useless she is.

06:01.797 --> 06:03.307
E-Excuse me...

06:03.587 --> 06:07.677
I'm actually only level 13.

06:07.677 --> 06:09.567
Maybe this isn't a good idea.

06:09.567 --> 06:12.237
It's fine. It's not a problem.

06:17.557 --> 06:18.987
Hey, Cline.

06:18.987 --> 06:20.837
What, Reiss?

06:23.537 --> 06:29.037
Isn't it strange for an E-rank adventurer 
to try so desperately to recruit Ruche?

06:33.047 --> 06:36.047
<b>Whisper</b>

06:33.047 --> 06:36.047
Maybe her skills are 
more useful than we realize.

06:36.217 --> 06:37.757
Whisper

06:36.367 --> 06:38.427
<i>Did I come across as too desperate?</i>

06:38.177 --> 06:39.757
Whisper

06:38.427 --> 06:40.887
They didn't do jack shit.

06:40.177 --> 06:41.557
Whisper

06:41.847 --> 06:44.087
They're pointless.

06:44.087 --> 06:45.007
But...

06:45.007 --> 06:46.437
What are you saying, Reiss?

06:47.067 --> 06:49.727
Just keep your mouth shut and let her go.

06:50.567 --> 06:54.397
It's better for us if she leaves quietly.

06:54.777 --> 06:57.407
Just think about it.

06:57.407 --> 07:01.777
A Heavy Knight couldn't have 
reached level 23 on his own.

07:01.777 --> 07:04.817
He's either bullshitting 
or was kicked from his party.

07:03.577 --> 07:05.077
Whisper

07:04.817 --> 07:06.917
Or he's hitting on her.

07:05.617 --> 07:07.077
Whisper

07:06.917 --> 07:09.167
If nothing else, Ruche has a pretty face.

07:07.707 --> 07:09.127
Whisper

07:09.627 --> 07:12.087
<b>Whisper</b>

07:09.677 --> 07:11.857
I suppose.

07:11.857 --> 07:14.667
Besides, this works out great.

07:14.667 --> 07:19.177
<b>Whisper</b>

07:14.667 --> 07:22.007
We wouldn't want the rumor to spread that 
we kicked someone for their bad build.

07:23.227 --> 07:25.267
That's true.

07:23.597 --> 07:25.267
<b>Whisper</b>

07:30.227 --> 07:34.137
Elymas, we were waiting 
for someone like you.

07:34.137 --> 07:35.987
Take good care of Ruche.

07:40.867 --> 07:42.607
I-In that case...

07:47.467 --> 07:50.427
I gratefully accept your kind offer.

07:50.427 --> 07:53.087
I look forward 
to working with you, Mr. Elymas.

07:54.607 --> 07:55.417
Yeah.

07:55.757 --> 07:57.627
Likewise, Ruche.

08:00.997 --> 08:04.597
<i>I just gained my first party member.</i>

08:07.017 --> 08:10.467
Congrats on your new party.

08:10.467 --> 08:15.477
You've never bought a decent 
weapon, right, Ruche?

08:19.717 --> 08:23.277
This 100,000 gold is 
a parting gift from us.

08:24.797 --> 08:27.037
Use it well.

08:31.427 --> 08:36.357
Th-Thank you, Mr. Cline...

08:38.117 --> 08:39.337
Don't pick that up.

08:39.837 --> 08:40.927
What?

08:41.997 --> 08:43.287
Cline, was it?

08:44.207 --> 08:47.887
Pick up the coins you threw on the ground.

08:48.257 --> 08:49.767
Even a child can do that.

08:50.307 --> 08:54.357
You call this a gift when you threw it 
on the ground? Yeah, right.

08:58.877 --> 09:00.247
Let's go, Ruche.

09:00.247 --> 09:03.157
B-But 100,000 gold is a lot of money...

09:03.447 --> 09:08.537
It's best not to owe 
anything to guys like him.

09:08.537 --> 09:09.537
Huh?

09:09.537 --> 09:11.537
O-Okay.

09:11.537 --> 09:13.187
Who do you think you're talking to?

09:13.187 --> 09:17.047
Have fun being useless together 
with your defective classes!

09:20.747 --> 09:22.247
Let's go, Reiss.

09:23.087 --> 09:26.157
Can I have this money?

09:26.967 --> 09:31.477
O-Of course not! It's mine!

09:29.687 --> 09:31.477
Ugh, you're so stingy.

09:31.477 --> 09:33.787
Sure, no problem.

09:32.427 --> 09:33.817
Thanks for waiting.

09:33.817 --> 09:35.067
Hey.

09:36.207 --> 09:39.537
Let's do a more lucrative quest next time.

09:37.797 --> 09:40.487
Be right there. Please be patient.

09:41.237 --> 09:47.157
Thank you for inviting me 
to join your party, Mr. Elymas!

09:48.377 --> 09:53.207
But I still don't think I'm strong enough.

09:53.707 --> 09:55.297
Don't worry.

09:55.737 --> 09:58.207
If we kill monsters suited to your 
skill trees, you'll level up in—

09:58.207 --> 09:59.207
So, actually...

10:00.007 --> 10:03.507
That got me thinking, Mr. Elymas...

10:03.967 --> 10:07.427
Did you help me because 
you fell in love at first sight?

10:08.477 --> 10:09.867
What do you mean?

10:09.867 --> 10:16.057
I've been wondering why someone 
above my level would stand up for me,

10:16.057 --> 10:18.547
and that's all I could come up with.

10:19.647 --> 10:22.417
I mean, I am cute.

10:22.417 --> 10:27.157
Um, and I think you're very handsome.

10:27.427 --> 10:31.157
But maybe we could start out as friends.

10:33.927 --> 10:37.317
I'm not that easy.

10:36.957 --> 10:38.497
<b>Tee-hee</b>

10:37.717 --> 10:38.797
Ruche.

10:41.637 --> 10:45.037
You have the Lady Luck
skill tree, don't you?

10:42.127 --> 10:45.427
<b>Skill Tree: [Lady Luck]</b>

10:46.277 --> 10:47.187
Huh?

10:49.377 --> 10:50.267
What?

10:51.427 --> 10:53.037
Am I being hasty?

10:52.337 --> 10:54.407
We were destined to meet.

10:53.037 --> 10:55.597
I wouldn't say that.

10:54.407 --> 10:56.277
Again!

11:00.547 --> 11:01.567
Ruche.

11:03.917 --> 11:07.487
You have the Lady Luck
skill tree, don't you?

11:04.567 --> 11:07.857
<b>Skill Tree: [Lady Luck]</b>

11:08.637 --> 11:09.627
Huh?

11:11.997 --> 11:12.837
What?

11:41.437 --> 11:48.857
<b>In Magic World,
 Dungeons (Dreamholes)</b>

11:41.717 --> 11:44.397
<i>In </i>Magic World<i>, 
Dungeons are the nightmares</i>

11:41.857 --> 11:48.857
<b>are the nightmares of the
sleeping God of Creation, Alxeros.</b>

11:44.397 --> 11:47.847
<i>of the sleeping God of Creation, Alxeros.</i>

11:49.597 --> 11:54.837
<i>Alxeros created countless gods and 
worlds from nothing over an eternity.</i>

11:55.707 --> 12:01.187
<i>But Alxeros, who'd remained the absolute 
god on high throughout that time,</i>

12:01.187 --> 12:07.417
<i>lost his mind and was sealed away 
by the very gods he created.</i>

12:08.917 --> 12:14.387
<i>However, Alxeros's nightmares 
are beginning to affect reality.</i>

12:15.167 --> 12:18.147
<i>His nightmares are creating gates 
in the real world</i>

12:18.147 --> 12:21.897
<i>that produce aberrant monsters and demons.</i>

12:27.567 --> 12:28.657
There it is.

12:28.657 --> 12:29.397
Huh?

12:33.037 --> 12:37.147
<i>Those are Dungeons or Dreamholes.</i>

12:37.247 --> 12:42.417
<b>Angel's Playbox Entrance</b>

12:37.837 --> 12:42.417
<i>Angel's Playbox Entrance.
Recommended level: 50.</i>

12:39.827 --> 12:42.417
<b>Recommended Level: 50</b>

12:42.727 --> 12:46.227
Are you sure you want me, Mr. Elymas?

12:46.227 --> 12:48.627
I mean, just look at me.

