12:48.627 --> 12:54.387
<b>Dice Thrust</b>

12:48.627 --> 12:54.387
<b>Dice Thrust</b>

12:48.897 --> 12:51.077
See?

12:51.077 --> 12:54.387
You really shouldn't be 
showing people that.

12:54.387 --> 12:56.407
Seriously?!

12:57.417 --> 13:02.687
It's fine. I know you won't tell anyone.

13:03.467 --> 13:06.977
Besides, I'd rather you abandon me now

13:06.977 --> 13:10.697
than get your hopes up 
just to disappoint you later.

13:13.107 --> 13:19.437
I can't even use my only attack skill, 
Dice Thrust, unless I roll a six.

13:15.557 --> 13:16.727
<i>Miss.</i>

13:17.197 --> 13:20.457
<b>Dice Thrust [Common Skill]
A thrusting skill
 Rolls a six-sided die and grants an
 additional effect based on the rolled result</b>

13:20.777 --> 13:26.277
If only I'd taken The Fool's Acrobatics 
or put points into Attack Booster.

13:26.707 --> 13:31.217
<b>Skill Tree: Pierrot</b>

13:26.707 --> 13:31.217
<b>Remaining Skill Points:</b>

13:26.707 --> 13:31.217
<b>The Fool's Acrobatics</b>

13:26.707 --> 13:31.217
<b>Lady Luck</b>

13:26.707 --> 13:31.217
<b>Attack Booster</b>

13:27.357 --> 13:30.787
I really screwed up, huh?

13:31.497 --> 13:32.627
It's fine.

13:35.257 --> 13:38.807
Ruche, I need you.

13:39.067 --> 13:42.307
What? Wh-What do you mean by that?

13:42.757 --> 13:48.107
Um, I'm not too familiar 
with that sort of thing.

13:48.107 --> 13:53.527
I need you to be more direct 
or I won't understand.

13:53.527 --> 14:00.337
Oh, um... but I shouldn't say that.

14:00.337 --> 14:01.837
It's not fair, is it?

14:01.837 --> 14:03.747
What? Oh, right.

14:04.337 --> 14:10.387
We're going to grind out an easy 
30 million gold and get you to level 30.

14:10.387 --> 14:11.697
What?!

14:11.697 --> 14:13.507
How the heck are we gonna do that?!

14:19.037 --> 14:20.177
Let's go.

14:20.177 --> 14:21.237
Okay.

14:57.217 --> 14:59.497
<i>The recommended level is 50,</i>

14:59.497 --> 15:02.647
<i>but I'm familiar with 
the monsters that spawn here.</i>

15:05.807 --> 15:08.127
<i>We won't encounter any serious danger.</i>

15:09.337 --> 15:13.067
<i>We're just going to grind levels 
on the upper floors.</i>

15:13.527 --> 15:19.167
I'll draw enemies to me, so use that
Ironpiercer knife to defeat them.

15:17.567 --> 15:23.237
<b>Ironpiercer</b>

15:17.567 --> 15:23.237
<b>Ironpiercer</b>

15:20.007 --> 15:23.237
I made the decision to come this far.

15:23.567 --> 15:26.777
You even bought me this expensive knife.

15:26.777 --> 15:28.867
I can't wimp out now!

15:28.867 --> 15:30.107
<i>Ironpiercer.</i>

15:29.247 --> 15:42.757
<b>Ironpiercer Recommended Level: 18
 Attack: +3
 Market Price: 550,000G
 This knife is effective against tough opponents
 When damage is applied, reduce the target's
 defense by 15% before calculating damage</b>

15:30.107 --> 15:34.307
<i>Attack +3. Market price: 550,000 gold.</i>

15:34.307 --> 15:37.697
<i>This knife is effective
against tough opponents.</i>

15:37.697 --> 15:38.887
<i>When damage is applied,</i>

15:38.887 --> 15:42.757
<i>reduce the target's Defense by
15% before damage calculation.</i>

15:42.757 --> 15:45.547
You can count on me, Mr. Elymas!

15:45.547 --> 15:49.267
I'll do what I can to live up to your 
inexplicable confidence and expectations!

15:50.217 --> 15:53.777
Uh, good. I'm glad 
you're feeling confident.

15:54.107 --> 15:58.277
I'll do all I can to protect you 
to repay you for buying me this knife!

15:58.857 --> 16:00.677
It's my job to protect you.

16:14.457 --> 16:18.257
<b>Monster: Patchwork Bear</b>

16:15.567 --> 16:17.927
There it is. It's a Patchwork Bear.

16:18.717 --> 16:22.727
Its appearance is cute, 
but its level, not so much.

16:23.577 --> 16:25.717
It has an Attack of 22.

16:25.717 --> 16:29.097
Even if you get hit somehow, 
you'll survive.

16:29.477 --> 16:32.437
You can't take a crit,

16:32.847 --> 16:37.417
but I can shut it down by throwing it 
off balance as it begins its attack.

16:38.657 --> 16:41.187
How do you know all that?

16:41.187 --> 16:41.887
Huh?

16:41.887 --> 16:44.337
Do you like Patchwork Bears?

16:45.727 --> 16:47.907
Not really.

16:49.247 --> 16:51.657
I'll handle its attacks.

16:51.657 --> 16:54.307
Ruche, attack from its 
blind spots and take it down.

16:54.307 --> 16:55.377
O-Okay.

16:55.677 --> 16:57.547
Watch out for its claws and fangs.

16:57.547 --> 16:58.417
Okay.

17:05.057 --> 17:06.607
Shadow Stomp!

17:05.967 --> 17:07.557
<b>Shadow Stomp</b>

17:07.557 --> 17:10.687
<i>I bought this skill using the skill points 
I gained from fighting the Mad Headder.</i>

17:10.137 --> 17:13.557
<b>Shadow Stomp</b>

17:10.137 --> 17:13.557
<b>Step on a target's shadow to prevent
 them from fleeing. The effect ends as
soon as your foot is no longer touching 
the ground</b>

17:10.687 --> 17:13.557
<i>I'll use this to help Ruche level up.</i>

17:16.677 --> 17:19.317
Shadows stretch farther 
than you think. Be careful.

17:19.317 --> 17:21.487
Got it.

17:22.477 --> 17:27.117
Huh? You said to watch out 
for its claws and fangs,

17:27.117 --> 17:30.497
but it doesn't seem to have either.

17:32.167 --> 17:33.367
What?!

17:55.967 --> 17:57.767
I'm glad I have this shield.

17:58.067 --> 18:01.887
Surviving attacks 
without moving my feet is a pain.

18:03.327 --> 18:06.567
Okay, Ruche. Keep hitting it.

18:06.567 --> 18:07.887
R-Right!

18:12.307 --> 18:16.037
It's not even cute anymore!

18:30.277 --> 18:33.427
That took a lot of attacks.

18:33.427 --> 18:36.927
But we managed to defeat it.

18:38.017 --> 18:40.297
Ruche, how many levels did you gain?

18:40.297 --> 18:41.567
What?!

18:41.567 --> 18:42.677
No way!

18:42.677 --> 18:46.947
Mr. Patchwork Bear, please drop something!

18:48.067 --> 18:52.947
I'm going to be 
kicked out of my party again!

18:53.647 --> 18:57.617
Don't worry. 
We just killed it for the EXP.

18:57.617 --> 18:58.457
Huh?

18:58.867 --> 19:02.877
I plan to kill a few more, 
so something will drop eventually.

19:05.437 --> 19:07.967
Speak of the devil.

19:08.687 --> 19:11.217
Same plan. Let's go.

19:11.217 --> 19:12.107
Got it!

19:30.567 --> 19:31.777
There's another one!

19:31.777 --> 19:35.377
Look, we got something!

19:35.377 --> 19:39.027
They dropped items. Two in a row, too!

19:39.027 --> 19:40.237
<i>Bear Shield.</i>

19:39.207 --> 19:46.167
<b>Bear Shield [Recommended Level: 10]
 Defense: +12
Market Price: 200,000G
 A cute round bear shield
 Low recommended level for its stats</b>

19:40.237 --> 19:42.117
<i>Defense +12.</i>

19:42.117 --> 19:44.267
<i>Market price: 200,000 gold.</i>

19:44.267 --> 19:46.167
<i>A cute round Bear Shield.</i>

19:46.547 --> 19:49.677
Aren't you glad you brought me?
 You are, aren't you?

19:49.677 --> 19:51.367
Are these useful, Mr. Elymas?

19:51.367 --> 19:54.047
What? Oh, uh...

19:54.047 --> 19:55.887
Well, we might as well take them.

19:55.887 --> 19:58.227
Yes, good idea.

19:58.917 --> 20:03.937
<i>That's odd. These items don't 
usually drop one after another.</i>

20:04.267 --> 20:08.607
<i>Did I misremember
the drop rate? No, but...</i>

20:09.107 --> 20:14.617
<b>Special Skill
Cat's Paw</b>

20:09.307 --> 20:14.617
<i>Ruche's Cat's Paw is a special skill 
that increases Luck by 500%.</i>

20:10.617 --> 20:14.617
<b>Luck</b>

20:15.267 --> 20:21.497
<i>If Ruche's starting Luck stat was high 
to begin with, this isn't impossible.</i>

20:22.127 --> 20:25.127
I wasn't expecting 
a Blood-Soaked Sword to drop.

20:25.917 --> 20:29.877
It's because of my skills, you know.

20:30.157 --> 20:34.487
I'm not sure that it really was 
because of your skills.

20:35.717 --> 20:40.437
<i>Then why didn't Cline's party realize 
how much she improved their drop rate?</i>

20:40.907 --> 20:45.687
You're so weak. Do you really think 
you'll get a cut of the sale?

20:42.077 --> 20:46.147
<i>Oh, right. They just didn't realize her
value because they're a newbie party.</i>

20:46.797 --> 20:49.927
<i>In this world, there isn't 
a lot of information on monsters.</i>

20:49.927 --> 20:53.617
<i>They must've gotten used to 
high drop rates from the start.</i>

20:55.227 --> 20:57.907
Was I useful, Mr. Elymas?

20:58.597 --> 21:03.037
Yeah. Ruche, thanks for 
teaming up with me.

21:07.247 --> 21:10.507
Did you want these 
Bear Shields that badly?

21:10.507 --> 21:13.967
Shall we collect ten of them today?

21:13.967 --> 21:16.467
No, you've gained enough levels.

21:16.867 --> 21:18.647
The real work starts now.

21:19.677 --> 21:20.307
What?

21:20.617 --> 21:22.737
<i>Level 20 reached.</i>

21:22.737 --> 21:25.567
Wow, you're right. When did that happen?

21:26.477 --> 21:31.697
Our new goal is hunting Golden Raana.

21:34.347 --> 21:37.117
G-Golden Raana?!

21:55.967 --> 21:59.467
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Krzysztof Kunc

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Sriram Gurunathan</b>

23:10.417 --> 23:13.877
<i>Ruche's power is even greater 
than I expected.</i>

23:14.477 --> 23:18.197
<i>No, this is still only 
a fraction of her power.</i>

23:19.047 --> 23:24.087
<i>No, I don't mean the Bear Shield. 
I'm not equipping that.</i>

23:24.557 --> 23:30.807
<i>In any case, now we can pursue our 
actual goal for visiting the dungeon.</i>

23:31.267 --> 23:32.687
<i>The real work starts now.</i>

23:33.937 --> 23:36.197
<i>Next time, "Golden Raana Farming."</i>

23:36.527 --> 23:39.307
<i>Every game needs a bonus character!</i>
